From a8a96a72286ee83b425a430bfd3c7867c8fac2ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael John <mj@tierone.software>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 08:43:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tip: free the getremcap capability buffer

cgetent()'s record buffer was unreachable after getremcap() returned;
the getcap contract keeps it live through the cget* extraction calls
but allows freeing after. ASan/LSan-verified on a pty-driven startup.
---
 src.freebsd/tip/tip/remote.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src.freebsd/tip/tip/remote.c b/src.freebsd/tip/tip/remote.c
index ecb2ecadb..5183f29db 100644
--- a/src.freebsd/tip/tip/remote.c
+++ b/src.freebsd/tip/tip/remote.c
@@ -193,6 +193,7 @@ getremcap(char *host)
 		CL = 0;
 	if (cgetnum(bp, "et", &ET) == -1)
 		ET = 10;
+	free(bp);
 }
 
 char *
-- 
2.43.0

